281
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:04,000
but don't try to be one of them.

282
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
remember you're the coach, you're not a player.

283
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,000
don't get on the field, don't try and join in the youth activities.

284
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
